<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover, user-scalable=no">
<title>Neon Rush</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Chakra+Petch:wght@500;700&family=Rubik+Mono+One&display=swap">
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #0a0820;
    --ink: #eef1ff;
    --ink-dim: #a3a9e0;
    --scrim: rgba(8, 6, 32, 0.66);
    --line: rgba(130, 140, 255, 0.35);
    --cyan: #3af0ff;
    --pink: #ff3d81;
    --amber: #ffa22e;
    --violet: #c084ff;
    --gold: #ffe45c;
    --mint: #5dffb8;
    --blue: #6ea8ff;
    --red: #ff5a36;
    --font-display: "Rubik Mono One", "Arial Black", Impact, sans-serif;
    --font-ui: "Chakra Petch", "Segoe UI", system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
  }
  /* The game is a night-sky scene in every theme, so the tokens stay dark. */
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root:not([data-theme="light"]) { --bg: #0a0820; --ink: #eef1ff; --scrim: rgba(8, 6, 32, 0.66); }
  }
  :root[data-theme="dark"] { --bg: #0a0820; --ink: #eef1ff; --scrim: rgba(8, 6, 32, 0.66); }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  [hidden] { display: none !important; }
  html, body { margin: 0; height: 100%; }
  body {
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    overflow: hidden;
    overscroll-behavior: none;
    touch-action: none;
    user-select: none;
    -webkit-user-select: none;
    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
  }
  #c { position: fixed; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; background: var(--bg); }

  /* ---------- HUD ---------- */
  #hud {
    position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 2; pointer-events: none;
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px;
    padding: max(14px, env(safe-area-inset-top)) max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-right)) 0 max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-left));
  }
  .score {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(28px, 6.5vw, 46px);
    line-height: 1;
    text-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(58, 240, 255, 0.55);
  }
  .combo { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-top: 10px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; color: var(--gold); }
  .chips { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; margin-top: 10px; }
  .chip { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--c); }
  .chip > span:first-child { min-width: 62px; }
  .bar { display: block; width: 84px; height: 6px; border-radius: 3px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14); overflow: hidden; }
  .bar b { display: block; height: 100%; width: 100%; background: var(--c, var(--cyan)); transform-origin: left center; transform: scaleX(0); }
  .hud-right { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; }
  .timebox { text-align: right; font-weight: 700; padding-top: 2px; }
  .timebox .t { font-size: 22px; }
  .timebox .b { font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-dim); font-weight: 500; }
  .icon-btn {
    pointer-events: auto; width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 12px; cursor: pointer;
    display: grid; place-items: center; color: var(--ink);
    background: rgba(16, 12, 60, 0.55); border: 1.5px solid var(--line);
  }
  .icon-btn svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 2; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  .icon-btn .off { display: none; }
  .icon-btn[aria-pressed="true"] .on { display: none; }
  .icon-btn[aria-pressed="true"] .off { display: block; }

  /* ---------- Panels ---------- */
  .panel {
    position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 3; display: flex; padding: 20px; touch-action: pan-y;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(8, 6, 32, 0.5) 0%, var(--scrim) 70%);
    backdrop-filter: blur(2px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(2px);
    overflow-y: auto;
  }
  .col { width: 100%; max-width: 460px; margin: auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; gap: 16px; }
  .title {
    margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(52px, 16vw, 96px); line-height: 0.95; letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    text-shadow: -0.045em 0 0 var(--pink), 0.045em 0 0 var(--cyan), 0 0 0.6em rgba(58, 240, 255, 0.4);
  }
  .title span { display: block; }
  .h2 {
    margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(34px, 9vw, 52px); line-height: 1;
    text-shadow: -0.04em 0 0 var(--pink), 0.04em 0 0 var(--cyan);
  }
  .lede { margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--ink); max-width: 34ch; }
  .btn {
    font: 700 20px var(--font-ui); letter-spacing: 0.02em; color: #04121a; background: var(--cyan);
    border: 0; border-radius: 14px; padding: 14px 40px; min-width: 210px; cursor: pointer;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 0 #148c99, 0 12px 30px rgba(58, 240, 255, 0.3);
    transition: transform 0.08s ease, box-shadow 0.08s ease;
  }
  .btn:active { transform: translateY(4px); box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #148c99, 0 6px 16px rgba(58, 240, 255, 0.3); }
  .btn.ghost { background: transparent; color: var(--ink); border: 2px solid var(--line); box-shadow: none; padding: 12px 40px; }
  .btn.ghost:active { transform: translateY(2px); }
  .btn:focus-visible, .icon-btn:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--gold); outline-offset: 3px; }

  .legend { list-style: none; margin: 8px 0 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; text-align: left; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.4; color: var(--ink-dim); }
  .legend li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 22px 1fr; gap: 10px; align-items: start; }
  .dot { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; margin-top: 4px; background: var(--c); box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--c); }
  .dot.sq { border-radius: 2px; }
  .how { margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: var(--ink); }
  .best-line { margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: var(--gold); font-weight: 700; }

  .badge { margin: 0; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--gold); color: #251b00; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; }
  .final { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(44px, 12vw, 72px); line-height: 1; text-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(255, 228, 92, 0.45); }
  .final small { display: block; margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-ui); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink-dim); text-shadow: none; }
  .stats { display: flex; gap: 28px; margin: 4px 0 8px; }
  .stats div { text-align: center; }
  .stats dt { font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-dim); }
  .stats dd { margin: 2px 0 0; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; }
  .actions { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; align-items: center; }
  /* ---------- Update 1: rewards, shop, missions, spin ---------- */
  .ico { width: 22px; height: 22px; flex: none; }
  .col.wide { max-width: 580px; }
  .h2.sm { font-size: clamp(28px, 7vw, 40px); }
  .btn.sm { font-size: 16px; padding: 10px 18px; min-width: 0; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #148c99; }
  .btn.ghost.sm { padding: 8px 18px; box-shadow: none; }
  .row { display: flex; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }

  .profile { width: 100%; display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding: 10px 14px; border: 1.5px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; background: rgba(16, 12, 60, 0.5); text-align: left; }
  .rank { font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.15; }
  .rank small { display: block; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink-dim); font-size: 13px; }
  .bar.wide { width: 100%; height: 8px; }
  .bar.wide b { transition: transform 0.9s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1); }
  .coins { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--gold); font-size: 18px; }
  .streak { margin: 0; font-weight: 700; color: var(--gold); font-size: 15px; }
  .pill { display: inline-block; margin-left: 6px; padding: 1px 8px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--gold); color: #251b00; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; }
  .pill.used { background: transparent; color: var(--ink-dim); border: 1px solid var(--line); }

  details.howto { width: 100%; }
  details.howto summary { cursor: pointer; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink-dim); font-size: 15px; text-align: center; list-style: none; }
  details.howto summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  details.howto[open] summary { margin-bottom: 10px; }
  details.howto summary:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--gold); outline-offset: 4px; border-radius: 6px; }

  .rewards { width: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; padding: 14px; border: 1.5px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; background: rgba(16, 12, 60, 0.5); }
  .earn { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--gold); }
  .earn small { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink-dim); }
  .levelup { margin: 0; color: var(--mint); font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; }
  .lvline { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink-dim); }
  .done-list { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--mint); }

  .panel-head { width: 100%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; }
  .tabs { display: flex; gap: 8px; width: 100%; }
  .tab { flex: 1; font: 700 16px var(--font-ui); padding: 10px; border-radius: 12px; cursor: pointer; color: var(--ink-dim); background: transparent; border: 1.5px solid var(--line); }
  .tab[aria-selected="true"] { color: #04121a; background: var(--cyan); border-color: var(--cyan); }
  .tab:focus-visible, .item .buy:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--gold); outline-offset: 2px; }
  .grid { width: 100%; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(150px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }
  .item { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 12px 10px; border-radius: 14px; border: 1.5px solid var(--line); background: rgba(16, 12, 60, 0.55); }
  .item.eq { border-color: var(--mint); }
  .item canvas { width: 72px; height: 72px; }
  .item .nm { font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; }
  .item .buy { width: 100%; font: 700 14px var(--font-ui); padding: 8px 6px; border-radius: 10px; border: 0; cursor: pointer; background: var(--gold); color: #251b00; }
  .item .buy.own { background: transparent; color: var(--ink); border: 1.5px solid var(--line); }
  .item .buy.eq { background: var(--mint); color: #04231a; cursor: default; }
  .item .buy:disabled:not(.eq) { opacity: 0.55; cursor: not-allowed; background: transparent; color: var(--ink-dim); border: 1.5px dashed var(--line); }
  .note { margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-dim); }

  .mlist { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
  .m { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 8px 12px; padding: 12px 14px; border: 1.5px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; background: rgba(16, 12, 60, 0.55); text-align: left; }
  .m .txt { font-weight: 700; }
  .m .rw { color: var(--gold); font-weight: 700; }
  .m .prog { grid-column: 1 / -1; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-dim); }
  .m .prog .bar { flex: 1; width: auto; }
  .m.done { border-color: var(--mint); }
  .m.done .txt { color: var(--mint); }

  .reel { position: relative; width: min(340px, 86vw); height: 104px; overflow: hidden; border: 1.5px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; background: rgba(16, 12, 60, 0.6); }
  .reel::before, .reel::after { content: ""; position: absolute; top: 0; bottom: 0; width: 56px; z-index: 2; pointer-events: none; }
  .reel::before { left: 0; background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(10, 8, 32, 0.95), transparent); }
  .reel::after { right: 0; background: linear-gradient(-90deg, rgba(10, 8, 32, 0.95), transparent); }
  .reel .mark { position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 0; bottom: 0; width: 3px; margin-left: -1.5px; background: var(--gold); z-index: 3; box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--gold); }
  .track { display: flex; align-items: center; height: 100%; will-change: transform; }
  .cell { flex: 0 0 88px; height: 80px; margin-right: 8px; border-radius: 12px; display: grid; place-content: center; text-align: center; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); border: 1.5px solid var(--c); color: var(--c); }
  .cell b { font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.1; }
  .cell small { font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-dim); }
  .spin-msg { min-height: 30px; margin: 0; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--gold); }

  /* ---------- Update 2: medals, leaderboard, ratings ---------- */
  .medal { display: none; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin: 0; padding: 8px 18px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border: 1.5px solid var(--mc, var(--gold)); color: var(--mc, var(--gold)); }
  .medal.show { display: inline-flex; }
  .medal .ic { font-size: 18px; }
  .menu-medal { display: none; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; color: var(--mc, var(--gold)); }
  .menu-medal.show { display: inline-flex; }

  .lbform { display: flex; gap: 10px; width: 100%; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  #lbName, #rateName, #rateComment { font: 600 15px var(--font-ui); color: var(--ink); background: rgba(16, 12, 60, 0.6); border: 1.5px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 12px; }
  #lbName, #rateName { flex: 1; min-width: 140px; }
  #rateComment { width: 100%; resize: vertical; font-family: var(--font-ui); }
  #lbName:focus, #rateName:focus, #rateComment:focus { outline: 2px solid var(--cyan); outline-offset: 1px; }

  .lblist { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; text-align: left; max-height: 46vh; overflow-y: auto; }
  .lbrow { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 34px 1fr auto; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 10px 14px; border: 1.5px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(16, 12, 60, 0.55); }
  .lbrow.me { border-color: var(--cyan); }
  .lbrow.top1 { border-color: var(--gold); box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(255, 228, 92, 0.25); }
  .lbrow.top2 { border-color: #c8ccd6; }
  .lbrow.top3 { border-color: #cd7f32; }
  .lbrank { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 15px; text-align: center; color: var(--ink-dim); }
  .lbrow.top1 .lbrank, .lbrow.top2 .lbrank, .lbrow.top3 .lbrank { font-size: 20px; }
  .lbname { font-weight: 700; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
  .lbscore { font-weight: 700; color: var(--cyan); font-size: 16px; }

  .avgRow { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
  .avgStars { position: relative; display: inline-block; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: 2px; }
  .avgStars .dim { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22); }
  .avgStars .fill { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap; width: 0%; color: var(--gold); }
  .avgNum { font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; }
  .avgCount { font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-dim); }

  .starPicker { display: flex; gap: 6px; justify-content: center; }
  .starPicker .star { background: none; border: 0; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22); cursor: pointer; padding: 2px 3px; }
  .starPicker .star.on { color: var(--gold); text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 228, 92, 0.55); }
  .starPicker .star:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--gold); outline-offset: 3px; border-radius: 6px; }

  .revlist { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; text-align: left; max-height: 38vh; overflow-y: auto; }
  .revitem { padding: 10px 14px; border: 1.5px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(16, 12, 60, 0.5); }
  .revitem .rhead { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; }
  .revitem .rstars { color: var(--gold); letter-spacing: 2px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .revitem .rtext { margin: 6px 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-dim); line-height: 1.4; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }

  #banner { position: fixed; left: 0; right: 0; top: 22%; z-index: 4; text-align: center; pointer-events: none; opacity: 0; padding: 0 16px; }
  #banner .b1 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(30px, 9vw, 60px); line-height: 1.05; text-shadow: -0.04em 0 0 var(--pink), 0.04em 0 0 var(--cyan), 0 0 0.5em rgba(58, 240, 255, 0.4); }
  #banner .b2 { font-weight: 700; color: var(--gold); font-size: 20px; margin-top: 8px; }
  #banner.show { animation: pop 1.7s ease-out forwards; }
  @keyframes pop { 0% { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.6); } 12% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.08); } 22% { transform: scale(1); } 80% { opacity: 1; } 100% { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-14px); } }
  #toast { position: fixed; left: 50%; bottom: max(24px, env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); transform: translateX(-50%); z-index: 6; padding: 10px 16px; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(16, 12, 60, 0.94); border: 1.5px solid var(--line); font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; transition: opacity 0.2s; max-width: 90vw; text-align: center; }
  #toast.show { opacity: 1; }
  #fx { position: fixed; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; z-index: 5; pointer-events: none; }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    #banner.show { animation: none; opacity: 1; }
    .bar.wide b { transition: none; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<svg width="0" height="0" style="position:absolute" aria-hidden="true"><symbol id="ico-coin" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9.5" fill="#ffe45c" stroke="#b8941a" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4.5" fill="none" stroke="#b8941a" stroke-width="2"/></symbol></svg>
<canvas id="c" aria-label="Neon Rush game area"></canvas>

<div id="hud" hidden>
  <div class="hud-left">
    <div class="score" id="score">0</div>
    <div class="combo"><span id="mult">x1</span><span class="bar" style="--c:var(--gold)"><b id="comboBar"></b></span></div>
    <div class="chips">
      <div class="chip" id="chipShield" style="--c:var(--mint)" hidden><span>Shield</span><span class="bar"><b id="barShield"></b></span></div>
      <div class="chip" id="chipSlow" style="--c:var(--blue)" hidden><span>Slow-mo</span><span class="bar"><b id="barSlow"></b></span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hud-right">
    <div class="timebox"><div class="t" id="time">0:00</div><div class="b">Best <span id="hudBest">0</span></div></div>
    <button class="icon-btn" id="btnSound" aria-label="Sound" aria-pressed="false" title="Sound (M)">
      <svg class="on" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 9v6h4l5 4V5L8 9H4z"/><path d="M16.5 8.5a5 5 0 0 1 0 7"/><path d="M19 6a8.5 8.5 0 0 1 0 12"/></svg>
      <svg class="off" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 9v6h4l5 4V5L8 9H4z"/><path d="M17 9l5 6M22 9l-5 6"/></svg>
    </button>
    <button class="icon-btn" id="btnPause" aria-label="Pause" title="Pause (P)">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 5v14M16 5v14"/></svg>
    </button>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="panel" id="menu" aria-labelledby="menuTitle">
  <div class="col">
    <h1 class="title" id="menuTitle"><span>Neon</span><span>Rush</span></h1>
    <p class="lede">Dodge the swarm, grab gold orbs, and stay alive as long as you can.</p>
    <div class="profile">
      <div class="rank"><span id="pRank">Rookie</span><small id="pLv">Level 1</small></div>
      <span class="bar wide" style="--c:var(--cyan)"><b id="pXp"></b></span>
      <div class="coins" title="Coins"><svg class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ico-coin"/></svg><span id="pCoins">0</span></div>
    </div>
    <p class="streak" id="streakMsg" hidden></p>
    <button class="btn" id="btnPlay">Play</button>
    <div class="row">
      <button class="btn ghost sm" id="btnShop">Shop</button>
      <button class="btn ghost sm" id="btnMissions">Daily missions <span class="pill" id="mPill">0/3</span></button>
    </div>
    <div class="row">
      <button class="btn ghost sm" id="btnLeaderboard">🏆 Leaderboard</button>
      <button class="btn ghost sm" id="btnRate">⭐ Rate &amp; review</button>
    </div>
    <p class="best-line" id="menuBest" hidden></p>
    <p class="menu-medal" id="menuMedal"><span class="ic" id="menuMedalIc"></span><span id="menuMedalTx"></span></p>
    <p class="how" id="how"></p>
    <details class="howto">
      <summary>How to play</summary>
      <ul class="legend">
        <li><i class="dot" style="--c:var(--gold)"></i><span>Gold orbs add score. Grab them quickly to build a combo multiplier.</span></li>
        <li><i class="dot sq" style="--c:var(--pink)"></i><span>Pink darts fly straight, orange hunters chase you, violet zigzaggers weave.</span></li>
        <li><i class="dot" style="--c:var(--mint)"></i><span>Pickups: the shield blocks one hit, the hourglass slows time, the bomb clears the screen.</span></li>
        <li><i class="dot" style="--c:var(--gold)"></i><span>Every run earns coins and XP. Spend coins in the shop on new ships and trails.</span></li>
